				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "G-NiceRF LoRa1280: SX1280, 12.5 dBm, ranging supported, no PA and no LNA, 16 x 16 mm, 16 pads. Chosen by ADR-139 over the 27 dBm E28 because two vendors rate the PA-class modules as NOT supporting ranging, and the 2.4 GHz legal ceiling (10 dBm EIRP) makes the PA unusable here anyway. Pin 9 is the antenna pad; the board carries no RF network for it (ADR-137)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
