	)	(text "TODO(unverified) ADR-128 DIRECTION OF TRUTH -- This sheet is DESIGN INTENT, not a mirror. Connectivity is read from tracker/hardware/connectivity/v10_pinmap.reg (sha256 recorded in the sheet header below); hub_board_v10.kicad_pcb is a BUILD PRODUCT of that registry and is NOT read here. Any disagreement between the registry and the board is a FINDING about the board, not licence to edit the schematic to match it."
