		(uuid "91792eef-88e6-549c-9e44-1b0a0311e1a0")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-16 J_PROG pin 6 (/IO0) -- J_PROG pin 6 carries /IO0 but NOTHING at the U1 end is connected to it: no U1 pad is assigned to /IO0 on v10. Cause: the WROOM-1U GPIO0 pad number is named by no in-repo source (an earlier guess of pad 25 was WRONG - pad 25 is IO48 and carries /U3_RESET_N - and was reverted in PR #266). Workaround in force: flashing works over USB-Serial-JTAG via EN + USB D+-, which needs no GPIO0. Closes when the Espressif pin table is read off a physical module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 415.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f36b28f-034b-529f-b369-2ece9a5bcc0b")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) CLOSED-ADR-139 the E28 PA/LNA enables no longer exist -- OPEN-E28-EN asked which GPIOs drive the E28-2G4M27SX's RX_EN (8) and TX_EN (9). ADR-139 replaced that module with the LoRa1280, which has no PA, no LNA and therefore no enables: the question is CLOSED by the part change, not waived. If the E28 is ever reinstated the item reopens."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 419.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9de8386-dd4f-599c-a1df-916be7c8a03d")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) U_C SITE-C CONTROL NETS -- /U_C_CS_N, /U_C_BUSY, /U_C_RESET_N and /U_C_IRQ are single-ended nets: they leave U_C and have NO destination on v10, because no U1 GPIO is assigned to them yet (ADR-119 site C). They are drawn as labelled stubs so the missing MCU side is legible rather than silently absent. Same class as OPEN-E28-EN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 422.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ba020f98-b88e-54e2-9f49-d2148df7520d")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) U_HUB_CVT 14 UNASSIGNED LANDS -- Only pins 1/2/3 (HUB_PV_P / GND / HUB_PV_N) are netted. The land pattern is a VQFN-16 + EP placeholder for the harvester the hub array is supposed to feed; the PART is unresolved (ADR-051 s4 items 3/5/6, OPEN-26), hence 14 unassigned lands. Drawn, not hidden."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 426.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8238ae57-56fe-5582-a37e-184a27ebd211")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) MECHANICAL FEATURES ARE NOT ON THIS SHEET -- The v10 board also carries H1..H4 (ADR-124 tether, NPTH D2.5) and HW1..HW4 (ADR-125 wing-string holes, NPTH D2.5). They are NPTH mounting holes with NO electrical net, so they are correctly absent from the netlist and from this sheet; they live in build_hub_board_v10.py (TETHER / WING_HOLES) and in the board's mechanical layer. The netlist parity gate can never see them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 430.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
