		(uuid "b383571a-7c0d-55e6-a90f-39e57fa8c41b")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) ADR-148 SOLAR OPEN-CIRCUIT VOLTAGE IS AN ESTIMATE, NOT A MEASUREMENT -- Every divider here is sized against V_OC,array(-60 C) = 9.58 V, which comes from wing-electrical s5.1: V_OC,cell(25 C) = 0.62 V and dV_OC/dT = -2.1 mV/(C.cell), BOTH marked TODO(unverified), with the cell datasheet absent from this repo. The protection resistor is sized so the 10 mA pin limit still holds at 103.6 V, i.e. 10.8x this estimate, so a wrong coefficient cannot damage the ADC -- but the CALIBRATION and the reported volts are only as good as the estimate until the cell is measured. Closes when the cell datasheet or a bench Voc sweep is on file."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 434.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "42f3f781-1667-57fb-8989-cc967a00b4ef")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) ADR-148 WING 4 VOLTAGE IS NOT DIRECTLY MEASURABLE -- The four wings are in series, so only three independent taps exist (/W1_SOLAR_P, /W1_SOLAR_N, /W2_SOLAR_N) and all three are measured. Wings 1-3 are differences of adjacent taps. Wing 4 is /W3_SOLAR_N to GND, and there is no eighth channel: ADR-148 spent all eight (4 cut + VSCAP + 3 solar). Adding a fifth monitor channel needs a third ADS1115, which is a v12 decision, not a v11 omission."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 438.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d1a93fc2-8d71-58df-ae4f-f05124fe2d6e")
	)	(text "TODO(unverified) ADR-148 U_ADC1 IS DNP AND ITS INPUTS ARE GROUNDED -- The cut-sense channels are allocated but not wired, because the sense element is a 10 mOhm series shunt that belongs to v11 item 3 and the ADS1115 input power-sequence qualification is BLOCKED (OPEN-25-CUTTER-ADC-SEQUENCE.md: a 3.6 V-powered-off TMUX1511 cannot be credited with protecting an unpowered ADC from a 5.4 V fault, and no hold-up domain is sized). Do NOT populate U_ADC1 and drive its AIN pins from the cutter node without closing that document first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
